## Security preparation successor — 2026-11-06

The current backend discovery, OSV cache and Opengrep rule/CLI observations are
superseded by scripts-security-preparation. Earlier evidence remains bound to its
original bytes; do not renew its hashes. The successor records current path
coverage, real offline default vulnerability scans, negative data tests and
portable discovery. Optional native Trivy/Grype execution remains unverified.
